  {
   "id": "doraemon-story-of-seasons-friends-of-the-great-kingdom-206815@major-2022-11-02",
   "gameId": "doraemon-story-of-seasons-friends-of-the-great-kingdom-206815",
   "displayName": "Notice of Patch Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-11-02T13:37:38.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Thank you for your support on DORAEMON STORY OF SEASONS: Friends of the Great Kingdom.",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A patch update has been released.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Patch Release Date: 2nd November 2022",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-----------------",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the issue where characters with the effects of “Come-Here Chow” cannot be set as a Buddy.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the issue where items are not shipped from the Ship Crate, when 18:00 is elapsed during an Event.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the issue where pets and animals disappear under certain circumstances.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Help pages can now be navigated by directional buttons. Please note that the Help pages during tutorial events are excluded from this change.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The stamina used up is reduced from 4 to 3, when using the Super Hoe and Super Watering Can with max power.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The reward for the following To-Do List Request is changed as follows.: “Stuffed Animal Clothes”: Reward: 1300 → 1650",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted the affection level increased when letting an Otter out.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Navigation from Sunswept Hill to Chitterchirp Woods is possible now from the wheat field at the back of the map.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the issue of unintentional movements to other locations under certain inputs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the issue where an item is unregistered from Favorites, when moved to another item slot.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the issue where the effects of the Invisible Cape and Unturned Stone Cap are not reflected to Player 2 during Offline 2-player multiplayer.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added the function to have dinner at home.: Examine Noby’s seat in the living room between 19:00 and 20:00 to trigger the event. Eating dinner restores the player’s stamina. The time will be 20:00 after the dinner event.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Items are now rearrangeable in the Fridge while selecting Materials for cooking.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the issue where the remaining effective time of a Charm expires after certain Events, regardless of the remaining time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted the number of materials needed for the Invention Inventor.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted the number of items obtained while purchasing certain animals for the first time.: Cow, Sheep, Alpca: Fodder 3 → 10: Chicken: Chicken Feed 3 → 5",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the issue where items disappear when the following actions are carried out.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Divvying up when picking up item",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Exchanging with an item with an item count of 99",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Exchanging with a different item",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Pressing “Cancel”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted the price of food at the diner due to game balance issues. The adjusted prices are as follows.: Cookie 340→180: Baked Yam 100→80: Cherry Tart 290→120: Clafoutis 410→220: Lemon Tart 410→120: Chocolate 110→60: Orangette 210→120: Seafood Salad 780→230: Mushroom and Clam Sauté 350→280: Grilled Pacific Saury 160→100: Macaroni & Cheese 560→220: Mushroom Pasta 290→200: Grilled Fish 110→90: Grilled Seafood 920→360: Yuzu Muffin 110→240: Persimmon Pudding 160→200: Pescatore 210→500: Longtooth Stew 160→720: Mayonnaise 200→300: Egg 100→200: Milk 150→250: Cacao 80→200: Strawberry 380→550: Almond 80→180: Apple 160→180: Pasta 150→300: Ketchup 200→700",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed issue where characters, animals, items, etc. enter an unintended state when starting or ending an event under certain conditions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resolved the phenomenon of certain events not being played properly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted certain sound effects.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted certain text.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved usability and overall game stability.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "-----------------",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please note that an internet connection is required to apply the update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
